+    /* LAB diagnostic: present-synchronized frame burst. Armed via the debug
+     * server ("framerec"); captures the completed backbuffer right before the
+     * swap, so every file is a full presented frame (unlike screenshot_hires,
+     * which can read mid-frame). */
